WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.167
Although it was a long time in coming after an exceptionally lengthy and dreary winter, spring finally arrived.

2
00:00:07.168 --> 00:00:14.148
For the March girls, springtime signaled new beginnings, new opportunities, and new dreams.

3
00:00:14.149 --> 00:00:21.482
Meg was already off to a good start that season, having been invited to several parties hosted by her wealthy friends.

4
00:00:21.483 --> 00:00:26.106
"What shall I wear?" was her most frequent complaint lately.

5
00:00:26.107 --> 00:00:31.248
Looking through the closet, Meg pulled out a light green dress and held it up to her body.

6
00:00:31.249 --> 00:00:37.007
Through the mirror, she could see that it suited her complexion and enhanced the color of her eyes.

7
00:00:37.008 --> 00:00:41.724
But the dress was quite a few years old, and its hem was worn.

8
00:00:41.725 --> 00:00:48.117
"Oh, what should I do?" Meg let out a sigh of frustration.

9
00:00:48.118 --> 00:00:53.405
"What's the matter, Meg?" asked Beth, walking in with an armful of folded laundry.

10
00:00:53.406 --> 00:01:01.525
Relieving her of some of the burden, Meg explained, "Annie Moffat is having a party this Saturday and I haven't got anything to wear."

11
00:01:01.526 --> 00:01:06.976
Beth replied thoughtfully, "You have many beautiful dresses, Meg."

12
00:01:06.977 --> 00:01:10.098
"But they're so old!" complained Meg.

13
00:01:10.099 --> 00:01:18.659
"Annie and the others will all have new silk dresses in this year's style, and I'll be the only one wearing an old, ugly dress."

14
00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:24.483
"I think you'll be the prettiest girl at the party, whatever you wear," Beth remarked.

15
00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:31.399
Cheering up a little at her sister's kind words, Meg continued with Beth's help to search for something to wear.

16
00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:37.317
"What about this dress?" Beth asked, pulling out a white gown with blue flowers all over it.

17
00:01:37.318 --> 00:01:42.554
Meg examined it closely for rips, holes, or stains but could not find any.

18
00:01:42.555 --> 00:01:47.253
In fact, the dress was in tip-top condition and it did flatter her a lot.

19
00:01:47.254 --> 00:01:53.066
"Thank you, Beth. This dress will have to do," Meg approved wholeheartedly.

20
00:01:53.067 --> 00:01:56.401
The much-anticipated evening was soon upon them.

21
00:01:56.402 --> 00:02:03.260
Leaving Meg to get ready for her big night, Jo and the others amused themselves by doing what they loved most:

22
00:02:03.261 --> 00:02:07.540
Jo was reading a novel (another one "borrowed" from Aunt March),

23
00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:14.404
Beth was playing the piano, and Amy was drawing a picture of one of Mr. Laurence's horses.

24
00:02:14.405 --> 00:02:20.636
"Has Meg come down yet?" Mother asked as she strolled into the living room, holding a velvet jewelry box.

25
00:02:20.637 --> 00:02:27.061
Shaking her head disapprovingly, Jo replied, "I don't know why it takes so long to get ready.

26
00:02:27.062 --> 00:02:31.471
Just throw the dress on, slip into your shoes, and you're good to go."

27
00:02:31.472 --> 00:02:39.469
Rolling her eyes, Amy said, "That's the difference between looking like a lady, and looking . . . well . . . just unladylike."

28
00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:44.120
"How do I look, girls?" Meg floated in while her sisters were talking.

29
00:02:44.121 --> 00:02:51.402
They all, including Jo, sucked in their breath, for Meg looked like an enchanted fairy princess.

30
00:02:51.403 --> 00:02:58.309
"You look positively beautiful," complimented Mother, smiling approvingly at her eldest daughter.

31
00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:03.913
"Oh, Meg, all the men at the party will want to dance with you," gushed Amy.

32
00:03:03.914 --> 00:03:11.714
"Just be careful with your heels this time," Jo said jokingly, reminding Meg of the last party they attended together.

33
00:03:11.715 --> 00:03:14.327
Laughing, Meg promised she would.

34
00:03:14.328 --> 00:03:23.091
"I thought tonight would be a proper occasion for you to wear this," said Mother, opening the jewelry box and taking out a string of pearls.

35
00:03:23.092 --> 00:03:25.866
She put them around Meg's slim neck.

36
00:03:25.867 --> 00:03:30.719
"Oh, Mother! They're perfect!" Meg's cheeks flushed with delight.

37
00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:34.022
"I feel like the most beautiful girl in the world."

38
00:03:34.023 --> 00:03:39.846
Saying good-bye to her family, Meg left for Annie's house in high spirits.

39
00:03:39.847 --> 00:03:44.662
When Meg got to Annie's house, however, her mood rapidly faded.

40
00:03:44.663 --> 00:03:52.723
At home, Meg may have been the radiant princess but among her friends, she felt like a farm girl on her way to milk the

41
00:03:52.724 --> 00:04:00.502
cows. "Meg, you look . . . so charming," was Annie's forced comment when she opened the

42
00:04:00.503 --> 00:04:06.364
door. "I like your hair. Did you do it yourself?" Sallie asked a little too

43
00:04:06.365 --> 00:04:12.909
sweetly. Meg touched the curls on her head and nodded shyly, trying hard not to stare at what her friends were wearing.

44
00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:21.067
Just as she suspected, Annie, Sallie, and Annie's sister Belle were all wearing silk dresses in pastel spring colors.

45
00:04:21.068 --> 00:04:27.363
Their hair was perfectly pulled back into a high bun with two curls hanging down the side of each cheek.

46
00:04:27.364 --> 00:04:35.670
Meg also noticed that her friends wore make-up on their lips, eyes, and cheeks. They looked sophisticated and very elegant.

47
00:04:35.671 --> 00:04:42.174
While Annie led her inside the house, Meg noticed Sallie and Belle whispering to each other.

48
00:04:42.175 --> 00:04:47.030
"Meg," Sallie said in a cheery voice as she took Meg's arm.

49
00:04:47.031 --> 00:04:54.585
"You have the most beautiful eyes and I think if you had just a little bit of color there, they would stand out even more."

50
00:04:54.586 --> 00:05:00.869
"I don't know," Meg said hesitantly. Mother did not approve of her girls wearing make-up.

51
00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:06.458
"It'll be fun! And you'll look even prettier," Annie tried to persuade her.

52
00:05:06.459 --> 00:05:12.814
"We're all wearing some. Don't you think we look nice?" Sallie pushed her face up closer to Meg.

53
00:05:12.815 --> 00:05:16.237
Meg had to admit her friends looked very lovely.

54
00:05:16.238 --> 00:05:20.605
"Well, maybe just a little then," she said, giving in.

55
00:05:20.606 --> 00:05:25.568
Chattering excitedly, the four girls hurried up the stairs, giggling.

56
00:05:25.569 --> 00:05:30.378
While Belle applied Meg's make-up, Sallie decided to change Meg's hair.

57
00:05:30.379 --> 00:05:37.265
Even before Meg could protest, Sallie swiftly pulled out the pins in her hair and brushed out the curls.

58
00:05:37.266 --> 00:05:40.379
"Your hair was lovely, but a little old-fashioned.

59
00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:47.458
I think this style will suit you even better," Sallie said as she pulled, curled, and twisted Meg's hair into a bun.

60
00:05:47.459 --> 00:05:55.396
"And your dress, which I love," Annie added rather hastily, "makes your skin look dull. But I think this one will make you glow!"

61
00:05:55.397 --> 00:06:02.356
Meg immediately fell in love with the bright blue silk dress Annie held up, but pride stopped her from admitting it.

62
00:06:02.357 --> 00:06:07.214
"I think what I am wearing suits me fine, thank you," she replied graciously.

63
00:06:07.215 --> 00:06:11.537
"Just try it on and see how it looks," begged her friends.

64
00:06:11.538 --> 00:06:18.131
Not wanting to disappoint them, Meg changed out of her old cotton dress and into the shiny silk one.

65
00:06:18.132 --> 00:06:23.793
Almost at once, she felt the difference as the soft silk wrapped around her body.

66
00:06:23.794 --> 00:06:29.332
She suddenly stood up taller, held her head higher, and felt more confident.

67
00:06:29.333 --> 00:06:37.409
After a few added touches to Meg's hair and make-up, Annie placed her hands on Meg's shoulders and turned her around to face the mirror.

68
00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:45.954
Meg gasped when she saw her reflection, for the face that stared back at her was not a farm girl's but a sophisticated young lady's.

69
00:06:45.955 --> 00:06:50.703
"Oh, Meg, please wear this dress tonight!" cried Annie.

70
00:06:50.704 --> 00:06:54.860
"Look at your amazing eyes and lips!" Belle pointed out.

71
00:06:54.861 --> 00:06:59.821
"Meg, look at how your hair enhances your cheekbones!" said Sallie.

72
00:06:59.822 --> 00:07:07.113
So finally Meg gave in to persuasion and agreed to wear the dress, make-up, and hairstyle her friends had chosen for her.

73
00:07:07.114 --> 00:07:12.456
Grabbing hands, the four friends jumped up and down excitedly complimenting one another.

74
00:07:12.457 --> 00:07:16.574
Meg felt so proud to be a part of this exclusive group.

75
00:07:16.575 --> 00:07:23.995
Still holding hands, the girls walked down to the party that awaited them.

